# AWS-0132: the Terraform state bucket is encrypted with an AWS-managed key (SSE-S3)
# rather than a customer-managed KMS key.
# Accepted: single account, single administrator, short-lived and cost-controlled
# environment. The bucket is private, versioned, TLS-only and encrypted at rest.
# Revisit if state ever holds secrets or the environment becomes long-lived.
AWS-0132
